hadiths[200]{hadithnumber,text}:
"401","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah Bahili (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Gunah kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo tumhare dil ko bechain kare, pas use chhod do. Us ne poocha: Iman kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo apni neki se khush ho aur apni burayi se ghamgeen ho, to woh momin hai."
"402","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo apni neki se khush ho aur apni burayi se ghamgeen ho, to woh momin hai."
"403","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Jabiyah ke muqam par khutba diya, aur unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hum mein khade hue aur Aap ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne is baat ka bhi zikr kiya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"404","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zubair (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne meri is jagah par khutba dete hue irshad farmaya: Mere sahaba ki izzat karo, phir un logon ki jo un ke baad aayenge, phir un ki jo un ke baad aayenge, phir jhoot zahir ho jayega aur aise log aam ho jayenge jin mein se har ek gawahi dega halanke us se woh (gawahi) talab na ki jayegi aur woh qasam uthayega halanke us se woh mangi na jayegi. Pas jis shakhs ko Jannat ka markaz pasand ho woh jama'at ko lazim pakde kyunke akele ke sath shaitan hota hai aur do se (shaitan) door hota hai. Pas koi mard kisi aurat ke sath khalwat mein na baithe kyunke un mein teesra shaitan hota hai. Aur jis shakhs ko us ki badi ranjeeda kar de aur neki khush kar de to woh momin hai."
"405","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo musalsal roza rakhe, haqeeqat mein us ne roza nahin rakha."
"406","[AI-translation] Note: Musannif ne yeh riwayat Imam Uqaili (Rahimahullah) ki sanad ke sath bayan ki hai. Imam Uqaili (Rahimahullah) farmate hain: Muhammad bin Ismail ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abun Nazr Hashim bin Qasim ne hamein bayan kiya, unhen Abu Uqaili ne bayan kiya, unhen Yazid bin Sinan ne bayan kiya, woh kehte hain: Main ne Bukair bin Fairuz ko suna, unhon ne kaha ke main ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo (raat gaye safar ke khatre se) dare woh raat ke ibtidayi hisse mein nikal pade, aur jo raat ke ibtidayi hisse mein nikal pade woh apni manzil ko pa leta hai. Suno! Beshak Allah ka maal qeemti hai. Suno! Allah ka maal Jannat hai."
"407","[AI-translation] Hasan al-Basri (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aakhirat ki izzat o azmat chahe use chahiye ke duniya ki zeenat chhod de."
"408","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat ko kasrat se nawafil padhe to din ke waqt us ka chehra khoob roshan hota hai."
"409","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat ko kasrat se nawafil padhe to din ke waqt us ka chehra khoob roshan hota hai."
"410","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat ko kasrat se nawafil padhe to din ke waqt us ka chehra khoob roshan hota hai."
"411","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat ko kasrat se nawafil padhe to din ke waqt us ka chehra khoob roshan hota hai."
"412","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat ko kasrat se nawafil padhe to din ke waqt us ka chehra khoob roshan hota hai. Is hadees ko a'imma-e-hadees ki ek badi jama'at ne riwayat kiya hai jabke Imam Abul Hasan Ali bin Umar al-Daraqutni ne is hadees ko Qazi Abu Tahir Muhammad bin Ahmad al-Dhahli ki ahadees mein se muntakhab kar ke riwayat kiya hai aur kisi bhi muhaddis ne us ki sanad ya matan par ungli nahin uthayi, halanke ba'z a'imma ne is hadees ka inkar karte hue kaha ke yeh (alfaz dar-asal hadees nahin balke) Shareek bin Abdullah ke apne alfaz hain aur unhon ne (un alfaz mein payi jane wali) mushabehat ko Sabit bin Musa al-Dhabi ki taraf mansoob kiya hai. Hamein Abu Bakr Muhammad bin Ali al-Ghazi al-Mutawwi' sakin-e-Makkah ne ba-tareeq-e-ijazah bayan kiya ke Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Hakim ne kaha: Qazi Shareek bin Abdullah ek hadees ki majlis mein hazir the, aur woh shakhs jo un se sun kar logon ko imla karata tha un ke samne tha. Pas Shareek ne ek hadees ki sanad padhi (aur sirf is muqam tak pohanchay thay) aur abhi hadees ka matan bayan nahin kiya tha, jab Sabit bin Musa majlis mein dakhil hue. Unhen dekh kar, un ke zuhd o taqwe ko dekhte hue, Shareek ne kaha: Jo shakhs raat ko kasrat se nawafil padhe to din ke waqt us ka chehra khoob roshan hota hai. Is jumle se Sabit bin Musa ne samjha ke Shareek ne sanad ke sath jo alfaz padhe thay woh hadees ka matan hain, pas apne samajhne ki bina par, unhon ne yeh alfaz Shareek ki sanad ke sath hadees ke taur par bayan kiye, halanke is sanad se is hadees ki koi bunyad nahin. Aur isi wajah se ba'z za'eef rawiyon ne, Sabit bin Musa se yeh hadees chura kar, use Qazi Shareek se hadees ke taur par bayan kiya. Haqeeqat yeh hai ke yeh hadees bahut si asnaad se marwi hai, aur bahut se siqah rawiyon se bhi Sabit bin Musa aur Qazi Shareek ke ilawa. Un asnaad mein se ba'z yeh hain."
"413","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat ko kasrat se nawafil padhe to din ke waqt us ka chehra roshan hota hai."
"414","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat ko kasrat se nawafil padhe to din ke waqt us ka chehra khoob roshan hota hai."
"415","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat ko kasrat se nawafil padhe to din ke waqt us ka chehra roshan hoga."
"416","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat ko kasrat se nawafil padhe to din ke waqt us ka chehra roshan hoga."
"417","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs raat ko kasrat se nawafil padhe to din ke waqt us ka chehra roshan hota hai."
"418","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apni dunyawi zindagi se mohabbat kare woh apni aakhirat ko nuqsan pohanchata hai, aur jo apni aakhirat se mohabbat kare woh apni dunyawi zindagi ko nuqsan pohanchata hai. Pas us ko tarjeeh do jo hamesha rehne wali hai (aakhirat) us par jo fana hone wali hai (duniya)."
"419","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Allah ke haakim ko ruswa aur zaleel kare, Allah use ruswa aur zaleel karega, aur jo Allah ke haakim ki izzat kare, Allah us ki izzat farmayega."
"420","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi qaum ke a'mal ko pasand kare, khwah bure hon ya achche, woh un logon ki tarah hai jo woh a'mal karte hain."
"421","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tum se Allah ke naam par panah mange use panah do; aur jo tum se Allah ke naam par mange use do; aur jo tumhen dawat de us ki dawat qabool karo; aur jo tum se neki kare use badla do; aur agar tum us ko badla dene ke liye kuch na pao, to us ke liye itni dua karo yahan tak ke tum mehsoos karo ke tum ne use badla de diya hai."
"422","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: (Bande ki) ghina yeh hai ke jo kuch logon ke hathon mein hai us se woh na-ummeed rahe aur tum mein se jo kisi lalach ki taraf maail ho to use chahiye ke aahista chale."
"423","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise Allah ne saath saal umar ata farmayi, to yaqeenan us ne umar ke bare mein uzr poora kar diya."
"424","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise Allah ne saath saal umar ata farmayi, to yaqeenan us ne umar ke bare mein uzr poora kar diya."
"425","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) ne yeh hadees Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak marfoo'an bayan ki ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo subah is halat mein kare ke kisi par zulm ka irada na rakhta ho, us ke gunah bakhsh diye jate hain."
"426","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ki gheebat mein koi gunah nahin jis ne haya ki chadar utar phenki ho."
"427","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bhi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek doosri sanad ke sath isi jaisi riwayat bayan ki hai ... aur hadees isi tarah bayan ki."
"428","[AI-translation] Hasan (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apni ghalti par ghamgeen ho woh bakhsh diya jata hai, agarche woh bakhshish na mange."
"429","[AI-translation] Hazrat Wasilah bin Asqa' (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah se dare, Allah har cheez ko us se darayega; aur jo Allah se na dare, Allah use har cheez se darayega."
"430","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Allah se milna pasand kare, Allah bhi us se milna pasand farmata hai, aur jo Allah se milna pasand na kare, Allah bhi us se milna pasand nahin farmata."
"431","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah se milna pasand kare, Allah bhi us se milna pasand farmata hai, aur jo Allah se milna pasand na kare, Allah bhi us se milna pasand nahin farmata. Muslim ne bhi use apni sanad ke sath isi jaisay alfaz mein riwayat kiya hai."
"432","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis se kisi ilm ke bare mein poocha jae jo woh janta ho, lekin woh use chhupae (aur na bataye), use aag ki lagam dali jayegi."
"433","[AI-translation] Qais bin Talq apne walid se riwayat karte hain. Aur woh (Qais ke walid) un mein se thay jo wafd ki soorat mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae thay. Woh kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis se kisi ilm ke bare mein poocha jae lekin woh use chhupae, use Roz-e-Qayamat aag ki lagam dali jayegi."
"434","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain, aur unhon ne ghaar wali hadees ka zikr kiya, aur us ke aakhir mein unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo apni koi neki chhupa kar rakh sakta ho, use chahiye ke aisa kare."
"435","[AI-translation] Hukm bin Umair (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab kisi ke liye khair ka darwaza khola jae to use chahiye ke use qabool karne mein jaldi kare, kyunke woh nahin janta ke kab us par woh band kar diya jayega."
"436","[AI-translation] Zamrah bin Habib (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab kisi ke liye khair ka darwaza khola jae to use chahiye ke use qabool karne mein jaldi kare, kyunke woh nahin janta ke kab us par woh band kar diya jayega."
"437","[AI-translation] Rasulullah ke sahaba mein se ek ke bete apne walid se riwayat karte hain, jinhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ghusse ko daba le halanke use zahir karne par qadir ho, Allah use aman o iman se bhar dega. Aur jo khubsurat libas pehenne se ruke halanke use pehenne par qadir ho ... Rawi Bishr bin Mansur ne kaha: Mera khayal hai Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aajizi o haya ki wajah se, Allah Ta'ala use izzat o waqar ka libas pehnayega. Aur jo Allah ki khatir nikah ka bandobast kare, Allah Ta'ala use badshahat ka taaj pehnayega."
"438","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo raat ke andhere mein masjidon ki taraf chale, Allah Ta'ala use Roz-e-Qayamat noor ata farmayega."
"439","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) ne use marfoo'an bayan kiya ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo raat ke andhere mein masjidon ki taraf chale, Allah use Roz-e-Qayamat noor ata farmayega."
"440","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo iman ki mithas chakhna chahe use chahiye ke kisi se mohabbat kare aur sirf Allah Ta'ala ki khatir mohabbat kare. Yahya bin Salim Abu Balj hain, aur yeh bhi kaha gaya hai ke woh Ibn Abi Salim hain."
"441","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah Hamsi se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo haram zariye se maal hasil kare, Allah use halakat ki taraf le jayega."
"442","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah Hamsi se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo haram zariye se maal hasil kare, Allah use halakat ki taraf le jayega."
"443","[AI-translation] Qarzi kehte hain ke Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu), Abu Sa'id Khudri, aur Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhum) jama hue. Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Tum mein se jo chahe woh koi aisi hadees bayan karne se ibtida kare jise us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna ho, us ke kanon ne woh hadees suni ho, dil ne mehfooz rakhi ho. Woh donon (Hazrat Abu Hurairah aur Hazrat Abu Sa'id) kehne lage: Ibtida aap keejiye, aap hamein woh hadees bayan karen jo aap ne yaad rakhi ho. Unhon ne kaha: Main aisa karta hun, main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Mujhe chhe cheezon ki zamanat de do main tumhen Jannat ki zamanat deta hun: Jab baat karo to jhoot na bolo, wa'da karo to khilaf-warzi na karo, jab amanat pakdo to khayanat na karo aur apni nazron ko jhuka kar rakho, apni sharmgahon ki hifazat karo, aur apne hathon ko (zulm se) roko. Phir Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ae Abu Hurairah! Ab tum bayan karo. Pas unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Abul Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Teen qism ke log Allah ke samne un ke hathon ko un ki gardanon se bandhe hue pesh kiye jayenge: Haakim, qazi, aur sardar. Sirf un ka adl unhen is halat se chhudayega, aur jin mein se unhon ne zulm kiya woh aag ke sab se sakht aur gehre hisse mein hoga. (Phir) Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Zameen kabhi itna nahin kanpti jitna woh junub ke ghusl ke ba'is ya na-haq qatl ke ba'is kanpti hai. Aur jo haram zariye se maal hasil kare, Allah use logon ke huqooq ke zariye zaya kar dega. Aur jo dunyawi logon ke paas subah ya shaam duniya talash karte hue jae, woh use pa to sakta hai, lekin (haqeeqat mein) woh un mein se hai jo Allah ki nishaniyon ka mazaq udate hain. Aur jo haakim ke paas jae aur apni khwahish ke mutabiq haq ke khilaf bole, woh aag mein us ka sathi hoga. Aur jo haakim ke paas jae aur apne bhai ki gheebat kare, Allah Roz-e-Qayamat us par apni rahmat haram kar dega. Yeh sun kar, Hazrat Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) takht se gir pade. Jab log chale gae, woh apni behan, Ummul Momineen Hazrat Umm Habibah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas gae, aur un se shikayat ki ke Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri aur Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne jan-boojh kar unhen aisi sakht ahadees sunayin ke woh shadeed ghamgeen hue. Hazrat Umm Habibah (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se us se bhi zyada suna hai jo Abu Hurairah ne zikr kiya. Mu'awiyah ne poocha: Woh kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jo neki kare, woh usi ke liye hai; aur jo burayi kare, woh bhi usi ke liye hai. Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Tum ne jo hadees bayan ki hai us ke baad, kaun hukmarani, qaza, ya sardari (aise ohdon) ki khwahish karega? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ke bandon mein sab se bure woh hain jo kehte hain: Ae hamare Rabb! Hamein duniya mein de, aur un ke liye aakhirat mein kuch nahin."
"444","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise narmi ka hissa diya gaya beshak use duniya o aakhirat mein khair ka hissa diya gaya, aur jo narmi ke hisse se mehroom raha beshak woh duniya o aakhirat mein khair ke hisse se mehroom raha."
"445","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm al-Darda (Raziyallahu anha) Hazrat Abu al-Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karti hain, jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jise narmi ka hissa diya gaya beshak use khair ka hissa diya gaya, aur jo narmi ke hisse se mehroom raha beshak woh khair ke hisse se mehroom raha. Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ke tarazu mein sab se bhari cheez husn-e-khuluq hai. Beshak Allah Ta'ala bad-khuluq aur bad-zaban shakhs se nafrat farmata hai."
"446","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Muhammad (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke main ne apni chacha-zad phuphi, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ko kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise narmi ka hissa ata kiya gaya use duniya o aakhirat mein khair ka hissa ata kiya gaya."
"447","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Allah ki mohabbat ko logon ki mohabbat par tarjeeh de, Allah use logon ki sakhtiyon se kifayat farmayega."
"448","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo jama'at se ek balisht bhar bhi alag hua us ne Islam ka tauq apni gardan se utar diya."
"449","[AI-translation] Rabi' (Rahimahullah) kehte hain: Jab (fitna-angez) log Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ki taraf nikle, main Hazrat Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas Mada'in mein gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo jama'at se alag hua aur qayadat ko zaleel kiya woh Allah se is halat mein milega ke wahan us ka koi rutba nahin hoga."
"450","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke (waqe'a-e-Harrah ke) fitne ke daur mein Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Ibn Muti' ke paas aae, unhon ne Aap ke liye takiya mangwaya aur Aap ko marhaba kaha, Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: Main tumhare paas sirf is liye aaya hun ke tumhen do aisi baatein bataun jinhen main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai, main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Jis ne (Imam ki) ita'at se apna hath kheench liya Roz-e-Qayamat us ke liye koi daleel o hujjat nahin hogi aur jis ne jama'at se doori ikhtiyar ki woh jahiliyat ki maut mara."
"451","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne Jabiyah ke muqam par apne khutbe mein yeh jumla kaha, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Jannat ke markaz mein rehna chahe use chahiye ke jama'at ko lazim pakde, kyunke shaitan akele ke sath hai aur do se door hai."
"452","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Jabiyah ke muqam par, Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne khutba diya, aur unhon ne ek taweel khutba zikr kiya, aur us mein yeh bhi tha: Tum mein se jo Jannat ke markaz ka khwahish-mand ho, to use chahiye ke jama'at ko lazim pakde. Unhon ne use mukhtasar bayan kiya."
"453","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo nadim shakhs ki bechi hui cheez wapas kar de, Allah Ta'ala Roz-e-Qayamat us ki laghzishon se darguzar farmayega."
"454","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo nadim shakhs ki bechi hui cheez wapas kar de, Allah Ta'ala Roz-e-Qayamat us ki laghzishon se darguzar farmayega."
"455","[AI-translation] Abu Ja'far (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apni zaban ko logon ki izzat pamal karne se roke, Allah Ta'ala Roz-e-Qayamat us ki laghzishon se darguzar farmayega."
"456","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo maan ko us ke bachche se juda kare, Allah Roz-e-Qayamat use us ke mehboobon se juda kar dega."
"457","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo halat-e-Islam mein budha hua, woh Roz-e-Qayamat us ke liye noor hoga."
"458","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tangdast ke liye aasani kare (qarz ki adayegi mein), Allah us ke liye duniya o aakhirat mein aasani farmayega."
"459","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tangdast ko mohlat de ya use mu'af kar de, Allah use apne Arsh ke sae mein jagah dega us din jab us ke sae ke siwa koi saya na hoga."
"460","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abul Yasar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tangdast ko mohlat de ya use mu'af kar de, Allah use apna saya ata farmayega us din jab us ke saye ke siwa koi saya na hoga. Rawi kehta hai: Phir Abul Yasar ne apne register par thooka (aur maqrooz ka naam mitaya) aur apne maqrooz se kaha: Jao, yeh tumhare liye hai (yani tumhara qarz mu'af hai), aur rawi ne zikr kiya ke beshak maqrooz tangdast shakhs tha."
"461","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abul Yasar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tangdast ko mohlat de ya use mu'af kar de, Allah use apna saya ata farmayega us din jab us ke saye ke siwa koi saya na hoga."
"462","[AI-translation] Ubadah bin Waleed bin Ubadah bin Samit (Rahimahullah) bayan karte hain aur Waleed bin Ubadah ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki suhbat hasil thi, (Ubadah ne) kaha: Main apne walid ke hamrah nikla us waqt main naujawan ladka tha, (hamein) ek aadmi mila, woh (Waleed) kehne lage: Chacha-jaan! Main ne aap ko pehchan liya hai, aap Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se hain. Yun hamein ek buzurg ki suhbat mil gayi, us buzurg ke sath us ka ghulam bhi tha jo ek register uthaye hue tha, mere walid ne us se kaha: Chacha-jaan! Aap ki subah kaisi hui? Us ne kaha: Khairiyat ke sath, mere walid ne kaha: Main aap ke chehre par ghusse ke aasar dekh raha hun, us ne kaha: Haan, falan bin falan ke zimme kuch qarz tha, main us ki talash mein gaya, main ne us ke darwaze par salam bulaya to ghar se ek chhota bachcha nikla, main ne us se poocha, aur us ne kaha ke woh (maqrooz) ghar par hai. Pas main ne pukara: Ae falan! Mere paas bahar aao. Pas woh mere paas bahar aaya. Main ne kaha: Tumhen kis ne der karayi jab main ne tumhen salam kiya, lekin tum na bahar aae aur na mujhe jawab diya? Us ne kaha: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, mere paas kuch nahin tha (paisa), aur beshak mujhe darr tha ke main tum se jhoot bolunga ya wa'da karunga phir use tod dunga. Main ne kaha: Kya waqa'i Allah ki qasam, jis ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin? Us ne kaha: Haan, Allah ki qasam, jis ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin. (Abul Yasar) ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par gawah hun; mere kanon ne Aap ko farmate suna aur mere dil ne use mehfooz rakha: Jo tangdast maqrooz ko mohlat de ya use mu'af kar de, Allah use us din saya dega jab us ke saye ke siwa koi saya na hoga. Unhon ne kaha: Is liye, main ne woh dastavez us se mita di. Ubadah bin Waleed kehte hain: Woh (Abul Yasar) ek dhari-dar chadar aur ek kadhai-dar choga pehne hue thay, aur un ka ghulam bhi aise hi libas pehne hue tha. Woh kehte hain: Main ne kaha: Chacha-jaan! Tumhen kis ne roka ke yeh kadhai-dar choga apne ghulam ko de do aur us se dhari-dar chadar le lo, taake tumhare paas do dhari-dar chadarein hon aur us ke paas do kadhai-dar chogay hon? Woh kehte hain: Woh meri taraf mutawajjeh hue aur kaha (mere walid se): Kya yeh tumhara beta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Pas unhon ne mere sar par hath phera aur kaha: Allah tumhen barkat de. Main gawah hun ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Unhen (apne ghulamon ko) woh khilao jo tum khate ho aur unhen woh pehnao jo tum pehente ho. Bhatije! Dunyawi maal ka nuqsan mujhe us se zyada mehboob hai ke mujh se aakhirat ki khair le li jae. Main ne apne walid se kaha: Abbu-jaan! Yeh buzurg kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh Abul Yasar bin Amr hain."
"463","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein do-zaban ho, Roz-e-Qayamat us ke liye aag ki do zabanein banayi jayengi. Ibn Khair (Rahimahullah) ne is hadees ke bare mein kaha: Allah Ta'ala Roz-e-Qayamat us ke liye aag ki do zabanein banayega."
"464","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki kitab (ya tehreer) mein us ki ijazat ke baghair dekhe, goya woh aag mein dekh raha hai."
"465","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Barzah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi ko neki ka hukm de, us ka apna rawaiyya bhi achcha hona chahiye."
"466","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo chalees subhein Allah ke liye khalis kar le, hikmat ki nehrein us ke dil se us ki zaban par behne lagengi. Goya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki murad woh shakhs tha jo chalees din Isha aur Fajr ki ba-jama'at namaz mein hazir ho. Aur jo un donon namazon ko chalees din pehli takbeer ke sath pa le, us ke liye do nijatein hain: Aadmi ke liye, do nijatein hain, ek aag se nijat aur ek nifaq se nijat."
"467","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne mehman ki izzat kare, aur jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne hamsaye ki izzat kare, aur jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke achchi baat kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"468","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Shuraih Khuza'i (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne mehman ki izzat kare, aur jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne hamsaye se achcha sulook kare, aur jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke achchi baat kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"469","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne mehman ki izzat kare, aur jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use apne hamsaye ko takleef na de, aur jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke achchi baat kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"470","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use apne hamsaye ko takleef na deni chahiye."
"471","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Shuraih Khuza'i (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke achchi baat kahe ya khamosh rahe, aur jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne hamsaye ki izzat kare, aur jo Allah aur Roz-e-Aakhirat par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne mehman ki izzat kare. Us ki mezbaani ek din aur ek raat ke liye hai, aur mehman ki mezbaani teen din ke liye hai; us ke baad, jo bhi diya jae sadqa hai. Aur kisi (mehman) ke liye jaiz nahin ke apne mezban ke paas is hadd tak thehre ke us ke liye bojh aur dushwari ban jae."
"472","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us shakhs ke liye jis ke hath par koi Islam qabool kare, Jannat wajib ho jati hai."
"473","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki ghair-maujoodgi mein us ki madad kare, Allah Ta'ala duniya o aakhirat mein us ki madad farmayega."
"474","[AI-translation] Abul Hasan Ali bin Umar al-Daraqutni (Rahimahullah) ne Kitab al-Ilal mein kaha ke Humaid al-Taweel ne Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya aur ... unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki ... kiya."
"475","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki ghair-maujoodgi mein us ki madad kare jabke use madad karne ki taqat ho, Allah Ta'ala duniya o aakhirat mein us ki madad farmayega."
"476","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki dunyawi takleefon mein se kisi takleef ko door kare, Allah Roz-e-Qayamat ki takleefon mein se kisi takleef ko us se door karega. Aur jo apne bhai ke uyub chhupae, Allah duniya o aakhirat mein us ke uyub chhupayega. Aur Allah apne bande ki madad mein rehta hai jab tak banda apne bhai ki madad mein rehta hai. Rawi, Ali bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Mujhe yeh khabar pohnchi hai ke rajul se murad A'sham hain (jin se Muhammad bin Wasi' ne riwayat kiya)."
"477","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai; woh na us par zulm kare aur na us par zulm hone de, aur jo apne bhai ki zaroorat poori kare, Allah us ki zaroorat poori farmata hai."
"478","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne momin bhai ki zaroorat poori karne mein masroof rahe, Allah Azza wa Jalla us ki zaroorat poori karne mein masroof rehta hai."
"479","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye masjid banaye, agarche woh chidiya ke ghonsle jitni chhoti ho, us ke liye Jannat mein ghar banaya jayega. Ya Aap ne farmaya: Allah us ka ghar Jannat mein banayega."
"480","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye masjid banaye, agarche woh chidiya ke ghonsle jitni chhoti ho, Allah us ke liye Jannat mein ghar banayega."
"481","[AI-translation] Hazrat Wasilah bin Asqa' (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ilm talash kare aur use pa le, us ke liye dohra ajar likha jata hai, aur jo ilm talash kare lekin use pa na sake, us ke liye ek ajar likha jata hai."
"482","[AI-translation] Amr bin Murrah (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke hum Abu Ubaidah ke paas baithe thay jab log riya' par guftagu karne lage. Ek buzurg jin ki kunyat Abu Yazid thi ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko kehte suna ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo apne a'mal logon ko dikhaye, Allah Roz-e-Qayamat us amal ko apni makhlooq ke kanon tak pohanchayega aur use zaleel o ruswa karega."
"483","[AI-translation] Amr bin Murrah (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke hamein Abu Ubaidah ke ghar mein ek shakhs ne hadees bayan ki ke us ne Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke hawale se hadees bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya aur ... unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki, is mein Yaum al-Qayamat (Roz-e-Qayamat) ke alfaz nahin thay."
"484","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aakhirat ke liye kiye jane wale kaam ke badle dunyawi faida talash kare, us ka aakhirat mein koi hissa nahin hoga."
"485","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis par ehsan kiya gaya aur us ne badle mein apne mohsin ki ta'reef ke siwa kuch na diya, to yaqeenan us ne us ka shukr ada kiya. Aur jo (mohsin ke ehsan ko) chhupae, to yaqeenan us ne nashukri ki."
"486","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis par ehsan kiya gaya use chahiye ke us ka badla de, aur jo is ki taqat na rakhta ho use chahiye ke (mohsin ki) ta'reef kare, aur jo aisa na kare us ne yaqeenan nashukri ki."
"487","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis se neki se pesh aaya jae use chahiye ke us ka badla de; agar woh is ki taqat na rakhta ho, to use chahiye ke us ka (neki ya mohsin ka) zikr kare. Agar woh us ka zikr kare, to beshak us ne us ka shukr ada kiya. Aur jo woh zahir kare jo us ke paas nahin, woh us ki tarah hai jo jhoot ka libas pehne. Aur Malini aur Ibn Kharras (Rahimahuma) ki riwayat mein alfaz hain: Us cheez ke sath jo us ne payi nahin."
"488","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Banu Abd al-Muttalib mein se kisi fard se duniya mein neki kare, aur woh (lene wala) duniya mein us ka badla dene ki taqat na rakhta ho, to Roz-e-Qayamat main us ki taraf se us ka badla dunga."
"489","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo kisi (Musalman ke) aib ko dekhe phir use chhupae, goya us ne zinda dafnayi gayi ladki ko us ki qabr se nikal kar use zindagi di."
"490","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, woh kehte hain ke un se kaha gaya: Hamare ba'z hamsaye sharab peete hain, kya hum unhen pakad kar (police ke) hawale kar dein? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, kyunke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo kisi (Musalman ke) aib ko dekhe phir use chhupae ... al-hadees."
"491","[AI-translation] Abu Dawood (Rahimahullah) ne kaha ke hamein Muslim bin Ibrahim ne apni sanad ke sath usi ki misl bayan kiya hai aur unhon ne min qabriha (us ki qabr se) ke alfaz nahin kahe."
"492","[AI-translation] Ali bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ne kaha ke hamein Muslim bin Ibrahim ne apni sanad ke sath us ki misl bayan kiya hai aur unhon ne min qabriha (us ki qabr se) ke alfaz nahin kahe."
"493","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs (har taraf se) kat kar Allah ki taraf ho gaya Allah use har mushkil mein kafi hoga aur use wahan se rizq dega jahan se us ka guman bhi na hoga aur jo shakhs (Allah se) kat kar duniya ki taraf ho gaya Allah use us (duniya) ke hawale kar dega."
"494","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Fuzail bin Iyaz (Rahimahullah) se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosre tareeq se bhi isi ki misl marwi hai aur us mein unhon ne kafahullahu ma'unatahu (Allah use us ki mushkil mein kafi hoga) ke alfaz zikr kiye hain."
"495","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs (har taraf se) kat kar Allah ki taraf ho gaya Allah Azza wa Jalla use us ki mushkil mein kafi hoga aur use wahan se rizq dega jahan se use tawaqqa' bhi na ho. Aur jo shakhs Allah se kat kar duniya ki taraf maail hua Allah use us (duniya) ke hawale kar dega."
"496","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"497","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Fuzail bin Iyaz (Rahimahullah) se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosre tareeq se bhi isi ki misl marwi hai."
"498","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo logon se Allah ki na-farmani ke zariye ta'reef chahe, us ki ta'reef karne wala aakhirkar us ka naqid ban jayega."
"499","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raza logon ki narazgi ke zariye talash kare, Allah us se razi hoga aur logon ko bhi us se razi kar dega. Aur jo logon ki raza Allah ki narazgi ke zariye talash kare, Allah us se naraz hoga aur logon ko bhi us se naraz kar dega."
"500","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raza logon ki narazgi ke zariye talash kare, Allah us se razi hoga aur logon ko bhi us se razi kar dega. Aur jo logon ki raza Allah ki narazgi ke zariye talash kare, Allah us se naraz hoga aur logon ko bhi us se naraz kar dega."
"501","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ko logon ki narazgi ke zariye razi kare, Allah use kifayat farmayega, aur jo logon ko Allah ki narazgi ke zariye razi kare, Allah use logon ke supurd kar dega."
"502","[AI-translation] Abu Abdur Rahman Hubli aur Khalid bin Abi Imran (Rahimahuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne nek amal par mara us ke mutalliq achchi ummeed rakho aur jo apne bure amal par mara us ke mutalliq andesha to rakho (lekin) na-ummeed na ho."
"503","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis shakhs se duniya mein koi gunah sarzad hua phir use us ki saza mil gayi to Allah ke insaf se ba'eed hai ke apne bande ko dobara us gunah ki saza de aur jis se koi gunah sarzad hua phir duniya mein Allah ne us par parda rakha aur us se darguzar farmaya to Allah ki buzrugi se ba'eed hai ke jis gunah se woh darguzar farma chuka ho ab dobara us ki saza de."
"504","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis shakhs ke paas woh taqwa na ho jo use tanhayi mein Allah ki na-farmani se rok sake to Allah ko us ke (baqi) amal mein se kisi cheez ki parwa nahin."
"505","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apni namaz achchi padhe jab log use dekh rahe hon, phir use buri padhe jab woh akela ho, yeh mazaq hai. Is ke sath, us ne apne Rabb ka mazaq udaya hai."
"506","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apni namaz achchi padhe jab log use dekh rahe hon, aur use buri padhe jab woh akela ho, yeh mazaq hai. Is ke sath, us ne apne Rabb ka mazaq udaya hai."
"507","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo namaz achchi padhe jab log use dekh rahe hon, aur use buri padhe jab woh akela ho, to yeh mazaq hai. Is ke sath, us ne apne Rabb Azza wa Jalla ka mazaq udaya hai."
"508","[AI-translation] Hasan (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar kisi shakhs ki namaz use behayai aur gunah se na roke, (to samjho ke) us ne use sirf Allah se aur door kar diya hai."
"509","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ki namaz use behayai aur gunah se na roke, (to jano ke) us ke zariye woh sirf Allah se aur door hota hai."
"510","[AI-translation] Abu Abdur Rahman Sulami (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke mimbar par yeh kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis shakhs ka koi achcha ya bura amal poshida ho to Allah us par us ki koi nishani zahir farma deta hai jis se woh pehchan liya jata hai. Aur (is sanad mein) Alqamah bin Murshid aur Abu Abdur Rahman ke darmiyan Sa'd bin Ubaidah ka zikr nahin."
"511","[AI-translation] Abu Abdur Rahman Sulami (Rahimahullah) Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain, kehte hain ke main ne unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke mimbar par yeh kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis shakhs ka koi achcha ya bura amal poshida ho to Allah us par us ki koi nishani zahir farma deta hai jis se woh pehchan liya jata hai."
"512","[AI-translation] Zuhri (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne kisi kaam ko gunah ke zariye sar-anjam dena chahe us ki ummeed kabhi poori na hogi balke woh jis cheez se bachna chahta tha us ke bahut qareeb ja pohanchayega."
"513","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne kaam ko gunah ke zariye sar-anjam dene ki koshish kare us ki ummeed kabhi poori na hogi balke woh jis cheez se bachna chahta tha us ke bahut qareeb ja pohanchayega."
"514","[AI-translation] Ummul Momineen Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke unhon ne apne ek ghulam ke bare mein qasam khayi thi jis ne un se aazadi mangi thi, ke agar unhon ne use aazad kiya to Allah use Jahannam se kabhi aazad nahin karega. Phir, jab tak Allah ne chaha, woh apni qasam par qayim rahin. Phir unhon ne kaha: Subhan Allah! Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo koi karne ya na karne ki qasam khae, phir behtar surat dekhe, use chahiye ke apni qasam ka kaffara de phir behtar surat ikhtiyar kare."
"515","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo karne ya na karne ke bare mein qasam khae, phir behtar surat dekhe, use chahiye ke apni qasam ka kaffara de aur behtar surat ikhtiyar kare."
"516","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Udhainah (Rahimahullah) apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi cheez ke bare mein qasam khae phir us se behtar surat dekhe, use chahiye ke behtar surat ikhtiyar kare aur apni qasam ka kaffara de."
"517","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi cheez ke bare mein qasam khae phir behtar surat dekhe, use chahiye ke apni qasam ka kaffara de aur behtar surat ikhtiyar kare."
"518","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke ek aadmi ne Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (Raziyallahu anhu) se kuch manga, pas unhon ne qasam khayi ke woh use nahin denge. Phir unhon ne kaha: Agar main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate na suna hota: Jo kisi cheez ke bare mein qasam khae, phir us se behtar cheez dekhe, use chahiye ke apni qasam ka kaffara de aur woh kare jo behtar ho, to main tumhen kabhi na deta. Phir unhon ne use de diya."
"519","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi cheez ke bare mein qasam khae, phir us se behtar surat dekhe, use chahiye ke apni qasam ka kaffara de aur behtar surat ikhtiyar kare."
"520","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi kisi cheez ke bare mein qasam khae, phir behtar surat dekhe, use chahiye ke apni qasam ka kaffara ada kare aur jo behtar ho use ikhtiyar kare."
"521","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum kisi cheez ke bare mein qasam khao, to apni qasam ka kaffara ada karo aur woh amal ikhtiyar karo jo behtar ho."
"522","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo in betiyon ke zariye aazmaya gaya phir un se achcha sulook kare, woh us ke liye aag se dhaal hongi."
"523","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke ek aurat mere paas is halat mein aayi ke us ki do betiyan us ke sath thin, aur woh (kuch) mang rahi thi. Mujhe apne paas ek khajoor ke siwa kuch na mila, pas main ne use woh khajoor de di. Us ne use do hisson mein taqseem kiya aur apni donon betiyon ko de diya, aur us ne khud us mein se kuch na khaya. Phir woh uth kar chali gayi. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae, pas main ne Aap ko is ke bare mein bataya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo in betiyon ke bare mein aazmaya gaya, woh us ke liye aag se dhaal hongi."
"524","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo baghair wajah ke chidiya ko qatl kare, to Roz-e-Qayamat woh (chidiya) is halat mein aayegi ke Arsh ke qareeb cheekhti hogi, kehti hogi: Ae mere Rabb! Us se pooch woh ne mujhe kyun qatl kiya."
"525","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo logon se un ka maal mange taake apna maal badhaye, haqeeqat mein woh jalti hoyi koyla mang raha hai. Ab us ki marzi, woh thoda mange ya zyada mange. Muslim ne use Abu Kuraib aur Wasl bin Abdul A'la (Rahimahuma) se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha ke Ibn Fudail (Rahimahullah) ne hamein apni sanad ke sath bayan kiya, aur unhon ne usi ki misl bayan ki."
"526","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ziyad bin Haris al-Suda'i (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur us ne Aap se sadqe ke bare mein poocha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khush-haal hone ke bawajood mange, woh us ke liye sar-dard aur pet ki beemari ka ba'is hoga."
"527","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khane ki dawat mein jae halanke use dawat nahin di gayi thi, to beshak woh chor ki tarah dakhil hota hai aur daku ki tarah nikalta hai."
"528","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise dawat di gayi lekin us ne dawat qabool na ki beshak us ne Allah aur us ke Rasul ki na-farmani ki, aur jo baghair dawat ke dawat mein hazir ho woh chor ki tarah dakhil hota hai aur daku ki tarah nikalta hai."
"529","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi ke ghar mein us ki ijazat ke baghair dakhil ho, woh chor ki tarah dakhil hota hai aur daku ki tarah nikalta hai."
"530","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo haakim ke paas apne Musalman bhai ke liye kisi neki ya mushkil kushaayi mein sifarish kare, Allah use Pul (Sirat) par karne mein madad farmayega us din jab qadam phislenge."
"531","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo haakim ke paas apne Musalman bhai ki taraf se kisi neki ya mushkil kushaayi mein sifarish kare, Allah use Roz-e-Qayamat Pul (Sirat) par karne mein madad farmayega us waqt jab qadam phislenge."
"532","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo haakim ke paas apne Musalman bhai ke liye kisi neki ya mushkil kushaayi mein sifarish kare, Allah use Roz-e-Qayamat Pul-e-Sirat par karne mein madad farmayega us waqt jab qadam phislenge."
"533","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo dastar-khwan se gire hue khane ke tukde khae, woh, us ke bachche, aur us ke bachchon ke bachche bars, kodh, aur deewangi se mehfooz rahenge."
"534","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Nardasheer (chaupad) khele woh us ki tarah hai jis ne apna hath khinzeer ke gosht aur khoon se aalooda kiya."
"535","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Nardasheer (chaupad) khele woh us ki tarah hai jis ne apna hath khinzeer ke gosht se aalooda kiya. Muslim bin Hajjaj ne use Zuhair bin Harb se Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi se Sufyan (Rahimahumullah) ki sanad ke sath riwayat kiya, aur us mein unhon ne kaha: Pas goya us ne apna hath aalooda kiya."
"536","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi qaum ka mehman bane use hargiz un ki ijazat ke baghair nafli roza nahin rakhna chahiye."
"537","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne kisi bid'ati ko jhatka Allah us ke dil ko aman o iman se bhar dega, aur jis ne kisi bid'ati ko zaleel kiya Allah use badi ghabrahat (Qayamat) ke din aman dega aur jis ne us ke liye narm-gosha rakha aur use izzat di ya use khanda-peshani se mila to beshak us ne Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nazil hone wali shari'at ko haqeer samjha."
"538","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne kisi bid'ati ko zaleel kiya Allah use bade khauf (Qayamat) ke din aman dega."
"539","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm al-Darda (Raziyallahu anha) Hazrat Abu al-Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karti hain, unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs is halat mein subah kare ke woh jismani taur par tandrust ho, apne mutalliq mutma'in aur be-khauf ho, us ke paas us ke din ki khurak maujood ho to goya use sari duniya jama kar ke de di gayi."
"540","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Muhsin (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo is halat mein subah kare ke apne maal mein mehfooz, apne badan mein tandrust, aur ek din ka khana rakhta ho, goya us ke liye sari duniya jama kar di gayi."
"541","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne duniya ki mohabbat apne dil mein baithayi woh yaqeenan teen cheezon mein mubtala hoga: Aisi mehnat jis ki thakan kabhi khatm na hogi, aisa lalach jo kabhi maal-dari ki taraf na le jayega, aur aisi ummeed jo kabhi apne maqsad ko na pohanchayegi."
"542","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Musalmanon ke kisi mu'amle ka zimmedar bana phir Allah ne us ke sath bhalayi ka irada farmaya to use woh koi nek wazeer muhaiya farma dega jo use bhool jane par yaad dilayega aur yaad rehne par us ki madad karega, aur Musalmanon mein nek wazeer se zyada ajar wala koi nahin jo kisi hukmaran ke sath rehte hue us ki baat bhi mane aur use zaat-e-Bari Ta'ala (ke ehkamat) ka hukm bhi de."
"543","[AI-translation] Hazrat Husain bin Ali (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke mujhe mere walid Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs logon par aamil bana phir us ne un par zulm na kiya aur un se baat karte waqt jhoot na bola aur wa'da kiya to khilaf-warzi na ki to yeh shakhs un logon mein se hai jin ki murawwat kamil hai, jin ka adl numayan hai, jin se ukhuwwat wajib hai aur jin ki gheebat haram hai."
"544","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis par koi faqa utra phir us ne use logon par pesh kiya to us ka faqa kabhi door na hoga aur agar us ne use Allah par pesh kiya to anqareeb Allah use be-niyaz kar dega, ya to jald hi (use) koi sarmaya mil jayega ya jald hi woh be-niyaz ho jayega."
"545","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main aur Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath thay jab Aap ne farmaya: Jo us ki hifazat kare jo us ke do jabdon ke darmiyan hai aur jo us ki do tangon ke darmiyan hai woh Jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"546","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujhe us ki zamanat de jo us ke do jabdon (zaban) ke darmiyan hai aur jo us ki do tangon (sharmgah) ke darmiyan hai, main use Jannat ki zamanat deta hun. Imam Tabarani (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Sirf Ma'qil bin Ubaidullah ne use Amr bin Dinar se riwayat kiya hai, aur un se riwayat karne walon mein Mughirah munfarid hai."
"547","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, to use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale."
"548","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Beshak, jo mujhe tumhen zyada ahadees bayan karne se rokta hai woh yeh hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, to use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale."
"549","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zubair (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke main ne (apne walid) Hazrat Zubair (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Beshak, main aap se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se itni ahadees nahin sunta jitni falan aur falan bayan karte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kabhi juda nahin hua, lekin main ne Aap ko farmate suna: Jis ne mujh par jhoot bandha, to use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale."
"550","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mere naam par naam rakh sakte ho, lekin meri kunyat mat lo ... (hadees jari hai). Aur usi hadees mein: Aur jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, to use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana tayyar kar le."
"551","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, to use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana tayyar kar le."
"552","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, to use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale."
"553","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... isi ki misl hadees bayan ki. Musa (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Is hadees ko hum ne sirf Abdul A'la se suna hai aur Abu Awanah to is hadees ko Abdul A'la az Sa'id bin Jubair az Ibn Abbas ki sanad se riwayat karte hain."
"554","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujh se hadees bayan karne mein ehtiyat karo, kyunke jo jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandhe use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale, aur jo Quran ke bare mein baghair ilm ke jhoot bole use bhi chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale."
"555","[AI-translation] Abu Maryam (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) se yeh kehte suna: Main tumhen Allah ki qasam de kar poochta hun, kya tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate nahin suna: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale? To Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) khade hue aur kuch bhi na kaha."
"556","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Khadij (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot ghadha, to use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale."
"557","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ya'la bin Murrah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par chhota sa bhi jhoot bandha, to use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale."
"558","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aus bin Aus (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne apne Nabi, ya apne bhaiyon, ya apne walidain par jhoot ghadha, woh Jannat ki khushbu bhi nahin sunghega."
"559","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Ubah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, to use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale."
"560","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par logon ko gumrah karne ke liye jhoot bandha, to use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale."
"561","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Yaqeenan, tumhari madad ki jayegi, aur tumhen fatah ata ki jayegi, aur tumhen maal-e-ghaneemat milega. Pas jo us (waqt) ko pae, use chahiye ke Allah se dare, neki ka hukm de, aur burayi se mana kare. Aur jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, to use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana tayyar kar le."
"562","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana tayyar kar le."
"563","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana banale."
"564","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana tayyar kar le."
"565","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana tayyar kar le."
"566","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nabit bin Shurit (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne jan-boojh kar mujh par jhoot bandha, use chahiye ke Jahannam mein apna thikana tayyar kar le."
"567","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat sakhtiyon aur dushwariyon se dhaki hui hai, aur Jahannam nafsani khwahishat se dhaki hui hai. Ishaq al-Farawi (Rahimahullah) is ke bayan karne mein munfarid hain."
"568","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jahannam nafsani khwahishat se dhaki hui hai, aur Jannat sakhtiyon aur dushwariyon se dhaki hui hai. Imam Muslim (Rahimahullah) ne bhi Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se apni sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne hadees bayan ki."
"569","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Us shakhs ke liye Allah ki mohabbat wajib ho jati hai jo ghusse mein aae lekin sabr se kaam le."
"570","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe mukhtasar guftagu ke sath bheja gaya hai aur mujhe rob ke sath madad di gayi hai."
"571","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"572","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri mashriqi hawa (Saba) se madad ki gayi, aur qaum-e-Aad maghribi hawa (Daboor) se halak ki gayi."
"573","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri mashriqi hawa (Saba) se madad ki gayi, aur qaum-e-Aad maghribi hawa (Daboor) se halak ki gayi."
"574","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"575","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri mashriqi hawa (Saba) se madad ki gayi, aur qaum-e-Aad maghribi hawa (Daboor) se halak ki gayi. Imam Tabarani (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Sirf Abu Awanah ne use Qatadah se riwayat kiya hai, aur Muhammad bin Aban use un se bayan karne mein munfarid hai."
"576","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara Rabb us naujawan ko pasand farmata hai jis mein koi lalach ya khwahish na ho."
"577","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jaise tum hoge, waise hi tum par muqarrar hukmaran honge. Ya (Aap ne farmaya): Waise hi tum par muqarrar sardar honge."
"578","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roz-e-Qayamat log apni niyyaton ke mutabiq uthaye jayenge."
"579","[AI-translation] Ali bin Musa (Rahimahullah) apne walid se, woh apne aaba se muttasil sanad ke sath riwayat karte hain, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jhooti gawahi dene wala Roz-e-Qayamat is halat mein uthaya jayega ke woh aag mein apni zaban chaat raha hoga jaise kutta apni zaban se gandagi mein chaat-ta hai."
"580","[AI-translation] Mus'ab bin Sa'd (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) kuch logon ke paas se guzre jo teer-andazi ki mashq kar rahe thay. Unhon ne un ki kamzori ki nishandahi ki, pas unhon ne kaha: Ae Ameerul Momineen! Hum sirf seekh rahe hain. Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne jo jumla kaha hai woh hamare liye tumhare kharab nishane se zyada sakht hai. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Allah us shakhs par raham farmaye jo apni zaban durust kare."
"581","[AI-translation] Hasan al-Basri (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us bande par raham farmaye jo, jab bole, sawab kamaye, ya jab khamosh rahe, salamti mein rahe."
"582","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne teen martaba farmaya: Allah us shakhs par raham farmaye jo, jab bole, sawab kamaye, ya jab khamosh rahe, mehfooz rahe."
"583","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas kayi martaba tashreef lae aur farmaya: Allah un par raham farmaye jo wuzu ke dauran aur khane ke baad miswak istemal karte hain."
"584","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain, jo apne Rabb Tabarak wa Ta'ala se riwayat karte hain, ke Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Jise mere zikr ne mujh se mangne se mashghool rakha, main use us se behtar dunga jo main mangne walon ko deta hun."
"585","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad (Rahimahullah) apne walid se, aur woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha ke Hazrat Abu Bakr, Umar, aur Abu Ubaidah (Raziyallahu anhum) jama hue, woh kisi cheez ke bare mein behas o mubahisa kar rahe thay to Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhen kaha: Tum hamare sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf chalo. Chunache jab woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hue to kehne lage: Allah ke Rasul! Hum aap ki khidmat mein ek cheez ke bare mein poochne ke liye hazir hue hain. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho to pooch lo aur agar chaho to main khud hi tumhen bata deta hun jis ke liye tum aae ho. Phir Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Tum mere paas rizq ke mutalliq poochne aae ho ke woh kahan se aata hai? Aur kaise aata hai? (Suno) Allah ne muqarrar kar diya hai ke woh zaroor apne momin bande ko wahan se rizq dega jahan se use guman bhi na hoga. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"586","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qareeb hai ke faqr o faqa kufr tak pohanch jae, aur qareeb hai ke hasad taqdeer par ghalib aa jae."
"587","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"588","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad (Rahimahullah) apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo logon ko pehchane woh aazmayish ke liye makhsoos kar diya gaya, aur jo unhen na pehchane woh un mein rahega."
"589","[AI-translation] Mus'ab bin Sa'd (Rahimahullah) apne walid se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin mein fitratan koi bhi khaslat ho sakti hai, lekin khayanat aur jhoot nahin."
"590","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Momin ki fitrat mein har khaslat ho sakti hai sawae khayanat aur jhoot ke."
"591","[AI-translation] Mus'ab bin Sa'd (Rahimahullah) apne walid se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin mein fitratan koi bhi khaslat ho sakti hai sawae khayanat aur jhoot ke."
"592","[AI-translation] Hukm bin Umair (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum aisi imaratein banate ho jin mein tum reh nahin sakte, aur aisa maal jama karte ho jise tum kha nahin sakte. Aur unhon ne yeh hadees mukhtasar bayan ki."
"593","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein wa'z karte hue farmaya: Ae woh insan ke jis ki intiha maut hai, ae woh insan ke jis ki manzil qabr hai, ae woh insan ke jis ka libas kafan hai, ae woh insan ke jis ka takiya mitti hai, ae woh insan ke jis ke hamsaye keede-makode hain, ae woh insan ke jis ke mulaqati Munkar o Nakeer hain, ae woh insan ke jo kal apni biwi ko chhodne wala hai, kitne hi aise log hain jo aaj ke din ka istiqbal to kar rahe hain lekin use poora nahin guzar saken ge aur kitne hi aise log hain jo kal ke muntazir hain lekin use pa nahin saken ge. Agar tum maut aur us ki raftaar dekh lo to zaroor ummeedon aur un ke dhokon ko napasand karne lago."
"594","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe ghafil par ta'ajjub hai halanke us se ghaflat nahin barti jati, mujhe duniya ki aarzu karne wale par ta'ajjub hai halanke maut us ki talash mein hai, aur mujhe munh phaad kar hansne wale par ta'ajjub hai halanke woh nahin janta ke us ne Allah ko razi kiya hai ya naraz."
"595","[AI-translation] Abu Ja'far Abdullah bin Masoor Hashimi (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us shakhs par bahut hi ta'ajjub hai jo Allah ki qudrat mein shak karta hai halanke woh apni takhleeq ko dekhta hai, us shakhs par bahut hi ta'ajjub hai jo dobara zinda hone ko jhutlata hai halanke pehli martaba (zinda hone) ko dekhta hai, us shakhs par bahut hi ta'ajjub hai jo maut ke baad zinda hone ko jhutlata hai halanke har din aur har raat woh marta hai aur zinda hota hai, us shakhs par bahut hi ta'ajjub hai jo daimi zindagi ke ghar ki tasdeeq karta hai lekin dhoke ke ghar ke liye koshan rehta hai, aur us shakhs par bhi bahut hi ta'ajjub hai jo takabbur karne wala, itranay wala hai halanke haqeeqat yeh hai ke woh ek nutfe se paida kiya gaya phir gali-sadi laash banega aur us halat mein woh nahin janta ke us ke sath kya kiya jayega."
"596","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin kitna hairan-kun hai! Allah ki qasam, Allah momin ke liye jo bhi muqarrar farmata hai woh hamesha us ke liye behtar hota hai."
"597","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roz-e-Qayamat qareeb aa gaya hai, aur log duniya ki hirs mein badh rahe hain, aur un ki doori (Allah se) sirf badh rahi hai."
"598","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Adam budha ho jata hai, lekin do cheezein us mein jawan rehti hain: Maal ki khwahish aur lambi umar ki khwahish. Imam Muslim (Rahimahullah) ne use Yahya bin Yahya, Sa'id bin Mansur, aur Qutaibah bin Sa'id se riwayat kiya, aur sab ne Abu Awanah (Rahimahullah) se isi jaisi riwayat ke sath bayan kiya."
"599","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman Quraishi (Rahimahullah) ka bayan hai ke main A'sham (Rahimahullah) ke han maujood tha ke kisi ne un se kaha: Hasan bin Ammarah (haakim) zulm karta hai to unhon ne kaha: Hairat ki baat hai ke ek zalim shakhs zulm ke kaamon par mamur hai, mutakabbir aur zalim se us ke siwa aur kya tawaqqa' ki ja sakti hai? Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman kehte hain ke us ke baad main Hasan bin Ammarah ke han gaya to us baat ka un se tazkira kar diya unhon ne rumal aur kuch kapde mangwa kar ek aadmi ke zariye A'sham ke han (bataur tohfa) bhijwa diye, agle din main A'sham ke paas zara jaldi chala gaya, main ne socha ke logon ke aane se pehle pehle main apni baat kar lun, main ne dobara Hasan bin Ammarah ka zikr chhed diya, to A'sham bole: Wah, wah, Hasan bin Ammarah ke to kya kehne? Woh kaise achche achche kaam karta hai. To main ne kaha: Kya yeh wahi shakhs nahin jis ke bare mein tum ne kal baat ki thi? Aur aaj tum us ki tareef kar rahe ho, yeh kya hai? Unhon ne jawab diya: In baaton ko chhodo. Khaisamah (Rahimahullah) ne mujhe Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hue bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fitri baat hai ke dil neki karne wale ki taraf maail hota hai, aur dil burayi karne wale se nafrat mehsoos karta hai."
"600","[AI-translation] Ismail bin Khayyat (Rahimahullah) bayan karte hain ke Hasan bin Ammarah ko pata chala ke A'sham ne un ke bare mein kuch narawa tabsira kiya hai to Hasan bin Ammarah ne kuch kapde un ko bhijwa diye. Us ke baad A'sham ne Hasan bin Ammarah ke bare mein tauseefi andaz ikhtiyar kar liya to un se is tabdeeli ke bare mein daryaft kiya gaya ke pehle to aap un ki mazammat karte thay aur ab un ki madah kar rahe hain? To farmaya, mujh se Khaisamah ne ba-riwayat Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) bayan kiya hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak yeh fitri amr hai ke dil ... Ibn Adi farmate hain: Main ne is hadees ko sirf isi ustaz se marfoo'an tehreer kiya hai warna yeh hadees A'sham se mauqoofan ma'roof hai."
